the-history-of-the-work-7 : List Word
the-history-of-the-work-7 = unlines (cons "What was built for the history of the work after onboarding (2026-11-15). Nothing new holds the history: the store already keeps" (cons "every checked definition under its content key and logs each binding of a name to a key with its" (cons (quoted (cons "time. The language reads that log as a value, `history " (cons "name" (cons "`, a List Binding (lib/history.cub)," nil)))) (cons "and views of it are code over that list; `hyperactive history NAME` shows every binding of NAME," (cons "in the order bound, with its UTC time." nil)))))
